What is not in this repository
------------------------------

A managed, hosted edition is offered separately: we run the server, handle
provisioning and quotas, and provide support and an SLA. Anything built only
for that service — the operator console, billing, account provisioning, SSO
integrations — is not part of this repository and is not covered by this
licence.

To be clear about a thing that is easy to misread: the multi-tenant *data
model* in this repository (tenants, subjects, per-tenant keys and branding) is
Apache-2.0 like the rest of it, and you may run as many tenants as you like on
your own installation. The commercial offering is the hosted service around it,
not permission to use that code.

